# omx-modgui-sync.service is WantedBy=plugin-qualify-sync.service on purpose: `systemctl enable omx-modgui-sync`
# (an opt-in the package never makes) links it under that unit, so the GUI sync starts after every plugin scan and a
# plugin installed, upgraded or removed is followed by its GUI. No other target gives that order.
omx-panel: systemd-service-file-refers-to-unusual-wantedby-target plugin-qualify-sync.service [usr/lib/systemd/system/omx-modgui-sync.service]
